    StyleBox["orbit", "TI"]}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "14921406-a108-4e8a-ab67-35787ef8fa17"],
 "\[LineSeparator][r] gives an analytical expression for the Teukolsky point \
particle source for a given {\[ScriptS],\[ScriptL],\[ScriptM]} mode. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["orbit", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "20f688fe-f5ac-4873-aecb-2952c45d490f"],
 " needs to be a KerrGeoOrbit object "
}], "Usage",
